    "CONTRACT.md 11.1: os fields attach as extensions[\"x-os-v1\"] (ABI ExtensionMap accepts x-* keys): PolicyCheckOsV1 (required), PolicyDecisionOsV1 and LeaseOsV1 (optional). The ABI types are unchanged.",
    "CONTRACT.md 11.2: AuditAppendBody.domain stays the one ABI value; the receipt kind is payload.kind (ReceiptKind).",
    "CONTRACT.md 11.3: every hash is the ABI ContentHash (sha256:<64 lowercase hex>).",
    "CONTRACT.md 11.4: new_app_id is a field of the fork_app ShellToolResultV1, never of the request.",
    "CONTRACT.md 11.5: region pattern (or \"local\"), runs[].status enum, InboxPrepareResult."
